      "side": 1,
      "message": "This formula doesn\u0027t match Jetty 12.1.11 for a sized thread pool.\n\nJetty uses max(1, min(processors/2, httpd.maxThreads/16)), so at the default maxThreads\u003d25 this derives to 1 selector, not processors/2.\n\nThe text should state the cap and that the selector count only starts to scale once maxThreads reaches 32 (32/16 \u003d 2).",
      "range": {
